        "event": "Coastal Flood Watch",
        "headline": "Coastal Flood Watch issued September 6 at 11:19PM AKDT until September 11 at 4:00PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Minor Coastal Flooding Possible. Water levels 4 to 6 feet\nabove the normal high tide line possible with the Wednesday and\nThursday high tides.\n\n* WHERE...Golovin.\n\n* WHEN...From late Tuesday night through Friday afternoon.\n\n* IMPACTS...Some beach erosion may occur. Water may reach up to\nthe lowest lying buildings.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Several days of gusty southwesterly winds\nare expected late Wednesday through Friday. Rain totals between\n1 to 2 inches are possible.",
        "severity": "Moderate",
        "certainty": "Possible",
